# Optional. Paper Digest works without a .env file: the first time you open
# http://localhost:5173 a setup screen creates your admin account and lets you
# pick an AI provider (Anthropic, OpenAI or any OpenAI-compatible API).
#
# Only if nothing is saved in the app, an Anthropic key here is used instead:
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
# CLAUDE_MODEL=claude-haiku-4-5        # fast model (lookups, checks)
# SUMMARY_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5-5      # smart model (summary, feed, podcast, video)
